---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Warboys Community Events Calendar"
description: "Community events calendar for Warboys, Cambridgeshire. Discover upcoming village gatherings, library storytimes, council forums, and history talks."
permalink: "/calendar/index.html"
---

<div class="page-header">
  <h1 class="page-title">📅 {{ village.villageName }} Community Events Calendar</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">Full schedule of upcoming village events, library sessions, council meetings, and community gatherings.</p>
</div>

<!-- Interactive Month Calendar Top Widget -->
<div class="briefing-block" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
  <div class="briefing-block-header" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
    <h3 class="briefing-block-title" id="cal-month-year">August 2026</h3>
    <div class="cal-nav-buttons">
      <button type="button" id="btn-prev-month" class="button-link">&larr; Previous Month</button>
      <button type="button" id="btn-today-month" class="button-link" style="margin: 0 0.35rem;">Today</button>
      <button type="button" id="btn-next-month" class="button-link">Next Month &rarr;</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="briefing-block-content" style="padding: 1rem;">
    <div class="calendar-grid-header">
      <div>Mon</div><div>Tue</div><div>Wed</div><div>Thu</div><div>Fri</div><div>Sat</div><div>Sun</div>
    </div>
    <div id="calendar-days-grid" class="calendar-grid-days">
      <!-- Generated via client-side script -->
    </div>
    <div class="calendar-legend">
      <span><span class="legend-dot legend-today"></span> Today</span>
      <span><span class="legend-dot legend-events"></span> Event Date (Click to scroll)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Full Events Schedule List Grouped by Date -->
<div class="briefing-block">
  <div class="briefing-block-header">
    <h3 class="briefing-block-title">📋 Scheduled Community Events</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="briefing-block-content">
    {% if events_calendar and events_calendar.length > 0 %}
      <div class="events-schedule-list">
        {% for item in events_calendar %}
          {% set itemIsoDate = (item.eventDate | default(item.date)) | isoDate %}
          <div class="event-card" id="events-date-{{ itemIsoDate }}">
            <div class="event-header">
              <h5 class="event-title">{{ item.title }}</h5>
              <div>
                <span class="badge-status badge-upcoming">
                  {{ item.eventTime | default(itemIsoDate) }}
                </span>
                {% if item.isRegular %}
                  <span class="badge-status badge-regular">Regular Event</span>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="event-meta">📍 {{ item.venue | default("Warboys Village Location") }}</div>
            <p class="event-desc">{{ item.content }}</p>
            <div class="card-strapline">
              <div class="strapline-left">
                <span class="strapline-source">Source: <a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.sourceName }}</a></span>
                <span class="strapline-sep">•</span>
                <a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="strapline-report-link">Full Event Details &rarr;</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">No scheduled community events stored in calendar currently. Ingest fresh source updates to populate.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Pass Calendar Events JSON to Client Script -->
<script>
  window.VILLAGE_EVENTS_DATA = {{ events_calendar | dump | safe }};
</script>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  const events = window.VILLAGE_EVENTS_DATA || [];
  const daysGrid = document.getElementById('calendar-days-grid');
  const monthYearLabel = document.getElementById('cal-month-year');
  const btnPrev = document.getElementById('btn-prev-month');
  const btnNext = document.getElementById('btn-next-month');
  const btnToday = document.getElementById('btn-today-month');

  let currentDate = new Date();

  // Find date of earliest event or default to today
  if (events.length > 0) {
    const firstEvtDate = new Date(events[0].eventDate || events[0].date);
    if (!isNaN(firstEvtDate.getTime())) {
      currentDate = new Date(firstEvtDate.getFullYear(), firstEvtDate.getMonth(), 1);
    }
  }

  const renderCalendar = () => {
    const year = currentDate.getFullYear();
    const month = currentDate.getMonth();

    const firstDayIndex = (new Date(year, month, 1).getDay() + 6) % 7;
    const totalDaysInMonth = new Date(year, month + 1, 0).getDate();
    const todayIso = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];

    const monthNames = ['January', 'February', 'March', 'April', 'May', 'June', 'July', 'August', 'September', 'October', 'November', 'December'];
    monthYearLabel.textContent = `${monthNames[month]} ${year}`;

    daysGrid.innerHTML = '';

    // Empty lead-in cells
    for (let i = 0; i < firstDayIndex; i++) {
      const emptyDiv = document.createElement('div');
      emptyDiv.className = 'cal-day-cell cal-day-empty';
      daysGrid.appendChild(emptyDiv);
    }

    // Day cells
    for (let day = 1; day <= totalDaysInMonth; day++) {
      const dayDate = new Date(year, month, day);
      const dayIso = dayDate.toISOString().split('T')[0];

      const dayCell = document.createElement('div');
      dayCell.className = 'cal-day-cell';

      const isToday = dayIso === todayIso;
      if (isToday) dayCell.classList.add('cal-day-today');

      // Check if events exist for this date
      const matchingEvents = events.filter(e => {
        const eIso = (e.eventDate || e.date || '').slice(0, 10);
        return eIso === dayIso;
      });

      if (matchingEvents.length > 0) {
        dayCell.classList.add('cal-day-has-events');
        dayCell.title = `${matchingEvents.length} event(s) on ${dayIso}. Click to scroll down.`;
        dayCell.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const targetEl = document.getElementById(`events-date-${dayIso}`);
          if (targetEl) {
            targetEl.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
            targetEl.classList.add('event-card-today');
            setTimeout(() => {
              if (!isToday) targetEl.classList.remove('event-card-today');
            }, 2500);
          }
        });
      }

      dayCell.innerHTML = `<span class="cal-day-number">${day}</span>`;
      if (matchingEvents.length > 0) {
        const dot = document.createElement('span');
        dot.className = 'cal-event-dot';
        dayCell.appendChild(dot);
      }

      daysGrid.appendChild(dayCell);
    }
  };

  btnPrev.addEventListener('click', () => {
    currentDate.setMonth(currentDate.getMonth() - 1);
    renderCalendar();
  });

  btnNext.addEventListener('click', () => {
    currentDate.setMonth(currentDate.getMonth() + 1);
    renderCalendar();
  });

  btnToday.addEventListener('click', () => {
    currentDate = new Date();
    renderCalendar();
  });

  renderCalendar();
});
</script>
